1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:17,895
Welcome to StreakFlow, the simple habit tracker that helps you build better habits, one day at a time. In this short guide, we'll set up the app, add habits, track them every day, and tour the dashboard, calendar, statistics, achievements and settings. Let's get started.

2
00:00:18,470 --> 00:00:25,589
When you open StreakFlow for the first time, a short six-step setup gets you going. Tap Continue to begin.

3
00:00:26,164 --> 00:00:31,782
First, enter your name. StreakFlow uses it to greet you on the home screen.

4
00:00:32,357 --> 00:00:40,800
Next, choose the areas you want to improve, such as Fitness and Learning. You can pick as many as you like, and change them later.

5
00:00:41,375 --> 00:00:55,137
Based on your goals, StreakFlow suggests a few habits to start with. Tap to choose the ones you want. Here, Workout and Read twenty pages are selected. You can edit them, or add more, at any time.

6
00:00:55,712 --> 00:01:02,520
Then turn on daily reminders. A gentle nudge at the right time is one of the best ways to keep your streak alive.

7
00:01:03,095 --> 00:01:07,114
And that's it. Tap Start My Streak to open the app.

8
00:01:07,689 --> 00:01:12,228
The habits you picked are already waiting on your home screen, ready for today.

9
00:01:12,803 --> 00:01:18,332
Now let's add a habit of our own. Open the Habits tab, and tap Add Habit.

10
00:01:18,907 --> 00:01:29,824
At the top, Ideas for you suggests habits based on your goals. Tap one to fill in the form instantly, or tap More ideas to see the rest. We'll write our own instead.

11
00:01:30,399 --> 00:01:36,957
Give your habit a clear title, like Drink water, and an optional description, such as eight glasses a day.

12
00:01:37,532 --> 00:01:41,041
Under Appearance, tap Icon to choose a symbol,

13
00:01:41,616 --> 00:01:46,580
and tap Color to pick a colour, so every habit is easy to spot at a glance.

14
00:01:47,155 --> 00:01:58,442
In Schedule, choose a category and a frequency: daily, weekly, monthly, or custom days. Then set a daily target. We want eight glasses, so the target is eight.

15
00:01:59,017 --> 00:02:04,941
Turn on Reminder, and pick a time. StreakFlow will remind you at that time every day.

16
00:02:05,516 --> 00:02:11,159
You can add more reminder times if you need them, and set an end date if the habit is only for a while.

17
00:02:11,734 --> 00:02:21,187
The preview shows exactly how your habit will look. When you're happy, tap the Add Habit button in the corner. It stays in reach wherever you are in the form.

18
00:02:21,762 --> 00:02:31,324
Your new habit appears at the top of the Habits tab. Because it has a target of eight, the button says plus one. Tap it each time you drink a glass.

19
00:02:31,899 --> 00:02:40,413
Each tap adds one step, and the progress bar fills up. Three of eight so far. The habit counts as done once you reach eight.

20
00:02:40,988 --> 00:02:46,551
As you scroll, the summary and filters slide away, so there's more room for your habits.

21
00:02:47,126 --> 00:02:52,630
For a simple habit, like Read twenty pages, tap Complete, and confirm.

22
00:02:53,205 --> 00:03:01,158
The card turns green, your streak goes up, and you earn XP. Tapped it by mistake? Just tap Undo.

23
00:03:01,733 --> 00:03:08,361
Tap the three-dot menu on any habit to edit, duplicate, archive or delete it, or to see its history.

24
00:03:08,936 --> 00:03:15,114
Tap Details to see everything about a habit: today's status, its schedule, target and reminder.

25
00:03:15,689 --> 00:03:23,782
Open Habit Statistics for your current and best streak, completions, missed days and total XP, with week, month and year views.

26
00:03:24,357 --> 00:03:29,426
Scroll down for your completion and success rates, and a day-by-day view of the week.

27
00:03:30,001 --> 00:03:39,269
Now the Home tab, your daily dashboard. The big card shows your day streak, your level progress, and how many of today's habits you've finished.

28
00:03:39,844 --> 00:03:45,597
Swipe through the analytics cards, and use Today's Habits to tick off habits right from the dashboard.

29
00:03:46,172 --> 00:03:53,475
Below the mini calendar, Weekly Progress shows your completions, XP, active days, and your trend compared with last week.

30
00:03:54,050 --> 00:03:59,883
Recent Activity lists what you've completed, and Insights give you short tips based on your progress.

31
00:04:00,458 --> 00:04:09,956
The Calendar tab shows your whole month. The shading on each day shows how much you completed, from none to perfect. Tap any day to see what you did.

32
00:04:10,531 --> 00:04:19,179
The Stats tab brings all your habits together: completion rate, XP, active days, your best day, and the day that needs attention.

33
00:04:19,754 --> 00:04:23,293
Charts show how your consistency changes over time.

34
00:04:23,868 --> 00:04:31,366
Stay motivated with Achievements. Unlock milestones for streaks and XP, and track your progress towards each one.

35
00:04:31,941 --> 00:04:37,944
In Settings, you'll find Premium, archived habits, achievements, your profile, and more.

36
00:04:38,519 --> 00:04:43,093
Under Appearance, choose a light, dark, or system theme.

37
00:04:43,668 --> 00:04:46,102
Here's StreakFlow in dark mode.

38
00:04:46,677 --> 00:04:56,355
Your data stays on your device, and the app works offline. Use Back up or restore to save your habits to a file, and import them again when you move to a new phone.

39
00:04:56,930 --> 00:05:11,172
Want more? StreakFlow Premium adds unlimited habits, no ads, a productivity score, advanced insights, weekly and monthly reports, extra colour themes, CSV export, and up to five reminders per habit.

40
00:05:11,747 --> 00:05:19,830
Have an idea, or spotted a problem? Tap Send feedback in Settings. Every message helps make StreakFlow better.

41
00:05:20,405 --> 00:05:32,662
That's everything you need to get started. Remember: small steps, big change. Add your first habit today, and keep your streak going. Thanks for using StreakFlow!
